- How would you monitor Dataflow backpressure and skew?
- How would you rotate CMEK without downtime and audit key usage?

## Why This Is Asked

This tests practical streaming ingestion, basic data quality checks, idempotent writes, and error handling with DLQs—core skills for real-time data pipelines.

## Key Concepts

- Pub/Sub triggers and message ack semantics
- Cloud Functions for lightweight validation
- BigQuery streaming inserts with insertId for idempotency
- Dead-letter policy and retry behavior
- Basic end-to-end test strategy (malformed payloads, replays, success paths)

